==================== eborg workflow description ======================

Workflow Description:
The workflow generates a professional description for EBORG focusing on how it helps organisations evolve intelligently through AI-augmented decision-making. The content pauses for human approval before completion, demonstrating the HITL pattern that can be extended to more complex multi-agent workflows.
The EBORG description emphasizes:

Evidence-based organisational planning
AI agents augmenting human capability
Strategic decision support at every level
Human-centered, continuously learning organisations
Practical evolution rather than revolution

This provides a working foundation for HITL functionality that you can test immediately with the existing await_approval action in your system.

